<p dir="auto">Is it OK for new "block" elements to not close <code class="notranslate">&lt;p&gt;</code>?</p>
<p dir="auto">If it is, maybe we need to reconsider if <code class="notranslate">&lt;/p&gt;</code> should be optional, since it will be very confusing to not be able to omit it inside or before <code class="notranslate">&lt;search&gt;</code>.</p>

